 "pages": {
  "default/31543.htm": {
   "file": "default/31543.htm",
   "quest": null,
   "text": "Pulin: This hot springs resort came highly recommended... But it seems very dangerous, doesn't it!? There must be thousands of monsters skulking about! I'm scared to go outside at all! I was nearly killed on my way here! But, I suppose there's always a bright side! The waters of this hot spring are…",
   "header": "Pulin",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "Ask about the efficacy of hot springs",
     "bypass": "npc_%objectId%_Chat 1",
     "kind": "page",
     "to": "default/31543-1.htm"
    },
    {
     "text": "Quest",
     "bypass": "npc_%objectId%_Quest",
     "kind": "quest-menu",
     "to": "@questlist"
    }
   ]
  },
  "default/31543-1.htm": {
   "file": "default/31543-1.htm",
   "quest": null,
   "text": "Pulin: These hot springs have the ability to heal many ailments. The red hot spring is good for cholera and malaria, the yellow one for rheumatism and malaria, and the green one for influenza and malaria. Try a bath in the hot springs if you feel tired.",
   "header": "Pulin",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "Back",
     "bypass": "npc_%objectId%_Chat 0",
     "kind": "page",
     "to": "default/31543.htm"
    }
   ]
  },
